{"id":"d4ca35593c6aba92","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence.md","title":"统一 Δ₂ 集合序列的近似数据","display":"df-uniform-delta2-sequence — 统一 Δ₂ 集合序列的近似数据","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence","aliases":["20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence"],"display":"df-uniform-delta2-sequence — 统一 Δ₂ 集合序列的近似数据","chapter":"7","section":"7.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Exercise 7.6.3 的 computable sequence 的精确输入约定","source_printed_pages":[161],"source_pdf_pages":[195],"depends_on":["[[20-df-computable-approximation]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-uniform-delta2-sequence — 统一 Δ₂ 集合序列的近似数据"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 7.6.3 的 computable sequence 的精确输入约定"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>161</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>195</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ea4f6c0d21b23194\" href=\"?note=ea4f6c0d21b23194\" title=\"20-df-computable-approximation\">20-df-computable-approximation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec C=(C_j)_{j\\in\\omega}\">\\(\\vec C=(C_j)_{j\\in\\omega}\\)</span> 为集合序列。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span> 为上游的全函数限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ea4f6c0d21b23194\" href=\"?note=ea4f6c0d21b23194\" title=\"20-df-computable-approximation\">20-df-computable-approximation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}delta2\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{UniformDeltaTwo}(\\vec C)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists c\\in\\mathcal C_3^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}\\land\\forall j,x\\ \\exists v\\ \\forall s\\ge v\\ [c(j,x,s)=\\chi_{C_j}(x)]].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}delta2\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{UniformDeltaTwo}(\\vec C)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists c\\in\\mathcal C_3^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}\\land\\forall j,x\\ \\exists v\\ \\forall s\\ge v\\ [c(j,x,s)=\\chi_{C_j}(x)]].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里要求一个普通全可计算三变量近似，允许逐点多次变化；不是要求每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_{C_j}\">\\(\\chi_{C_j}\\)</span> 可计算，也不只是分别知道各个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_j\\le_T0&#39;\">\\(C_j\\le_T0&#39;\\)</span> 而没有统一的近似指标。原书习题的有效序列输入在此固定为这份可以运行的近似数据。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 7.6.3 的 computable sequence 的精确输入约定；印刷页 161；PDF 第 195 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable-approximation","status":"resolved","id":"ea4f6c0d21b23194","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-approximation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable-approximation","status":"resolved","id":"ea4f6c0d21b23194","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\vec C=(C_j)_{j\\in\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}delta2\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{UniformDeltaTwo}(\\vec C)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists c\\in\\mathcal C_3^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}\\land\\forall j,x\\ \\exists v\\ \\forall s\\ge v\\ [c(j,x,s)=\\chi_{C_j}(x)]].","display":true},{"tex":"\\chi_{C_j}","display":false},{"tex":"C_j\\le_T0'","display":false}],"bytes":1661,"backlinks":[{"id":"f16b26daaddf947e","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-countable-delta2-splitting]]；see [[20-prop-disjoint-ce-join]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence]]；see [[20-thm-K-undecidable]]；see [[20-df-K]]。"},{"id":"38ffff953003d9fb","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence]]；see [[20-df-maximal-agreement]]；see [[20-lem-delta2-preservation]]；see [[20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit]]；see [[20-thm-single-event-enumeration]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"}],"outgoing":["ea4f6c0d21b23194","e343870c773cb68e"]}